  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASEAN 2024 Public Sector Leadership (Senior Level Officials) Short Course</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A course for 30 senior officials from across ASEAN and Timor-Leste run over&#xA0;2 weeks, designed to improve public sector efficiency and effectiveness.&#xA0; The course will cover strategic leadership, people leadership, delivery management and ethics and transparency, as well as&#xA0;negotiation and presentation skills.</narrative>
  </description>
